    // For a fixed pair of planets (buy, sell), we want to maximize profit.
    // For each item type j, the profit per item is (sellPlanet.items[j].b - buyPlanet.items[j].a).
    // We can buy at most buyPlanet.items[j].c items of type j.
    // Total items <= k.
    // This is a bounded knapsack problem where each item type j has:
    //   value = sellPlanet.items[j].b - buyPlanet.items[j].a
    //   weight = 1 (per item)
    //   max count = buyPlanet.items[j].c
    // We want to maximize total value with total weight <= k.

