    // For each pair of planets (buyPlanet, sellPlanet), buyPlanet != sellPlanet
    // We want to maximize profit = sum over items of (sellPrice - buyPrice) * quantity
    // Subject to:
    //   0 <= quantity_j <= c_buyPlanet[j]
    //   sum of quantity_j <= k

    // Since we can choose any quantity up to c for each item, and the profit per item is (b_sell - a_buy),
